action; system SHOULD record rotation timestamp."}]}],"id":"blk-91491","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155340","text":"If provider requires redeploy for new secret values to take effect, UI MUST make this explicit."}]}],"id":"blk-91493","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-91495","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-155341","text":"Security & compliance notes"}]},{"id":"blk-91496","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155342","text":"This ADR supports a SOC2-aligned posture by:"}]}],"id":"blk-91497","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155343","text":"minimizing sensitive data stored in primary DB,"}]}],"id":"blk-91499","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155344","text":"ensuring integrity of billing-relevant telemetry,"}]}],"id":"blk-91501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155345","text":"enabling auditability (via audit logs for secrets set and telemetry rejections)."}]}],"id":"blk-91503","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155346","text":"This ADR does not eliminate the inherent risk that untrusted customer agent code can exfiltrate secrets it is given; the platform mitigates by scoping secrets per agent and avoiding cross-tenant exposure."}]}],"id":"blk-91505","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-91507","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-155347","text":"Acceptance criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-91508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155348","text":"This ADR is correctly implemented when:"}]},{"id":"blk-91509","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-91511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-155349","text":"No plaintext secret values exist in the primary DB (verified via code review and automated 